From: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 23:04:17 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(control): add models.status action and
 /api/openchamber/models/status route

Adds a models.status control action that reports live availability of the
location's model catalog. Providers on an OpenAI chat-completions package
with a configured http(s) baseURL are probed with a minimal completion
(max_tokens: 1, 10s timeout); every other model reports its catalog status.
The bearer key resolves from the provider's configured apiKey ({env:NAME}
references read the environment) with a fallback to the stored OpenCode
credential. The result is also served as GET /api/openchamber/models/status.
